# Data stack on `data` (UAT)

Edit git clones under `/root/DEV`: `data-cube`, `data-superset`, `data-models`, `data-engineering`. Workspace: `/root/DEV/data-stack.code-workspace`.

Compose runtimes + app data/logs on **`/data`**: `/data/cube`, `/data/superset-bi`. Docker **images** stay on the OS disk (`/var/lib/docker`). Not under `/root`, and not named after people. Do not commit from runtime trees.

## GitHub and branches

Remotes: `https://github.com/b4b-payments/data-cube` and `data-superset` (write), plus `data-models` and `data-engineering`.

- `main` — default; clone and PR target
- `develop` — UAT line (synced with `main` for now)
- `production` — prod line (later, when ECS is wired)

```bash
git switch main && git pull
git switch -c feature/short-slug
gh pr create --base main --title "feat: short summary"
```

## Architecture

Self-serve: Superset → Cube SQL → Redshift `destin2` (schema `spike`).
Eng-only optional database: `Redshift (eng-only)`.
Product filter is first-class: `B4B` | `B4S` | `OVERSIGHT`.
Airbyte is not in the active plan this phase.

## URLs (VPN/VPC only)

Prefer `*.b4b.rocks`. Cube `https://cube.b4b.rocks/`. B4B BI `https://dw.b4b.rocks/`. Payments `https://dw.b4b.rocks/superset/dashboard/payments/`.

Eng ports on **`data`** (`172.19.0.212`) if needed: Cube HTTP `:4000`, BI `:4001`, Cube SQL `:4002`.

## Secrets

AWS Secrets Manager `eu-west-2` is source of truth: `dev-data-cube_secrets`, `dev-data-superset_secrets`. Host notes: `/root/khauram/ACCESS.md` (do not commit).

Hydrate before compose on **`data`** (`AWS_PROFILE=390630218113_AdministratorAccess`, `AWS_REGION=eu-west-2`):

```bash
python3 /root/DEV/data-cube/scripts/secrets_env.py hydrate --env-file /data/cube/.env
python3 /root/DEV/data-superset/scripts/secrets_env.py hydrate --env-file /data/superset-bi/.env
```

Push `.env` edits with `secrets_env.py sync --env-file …`.

## Naming

User-facing: B4B BI, Cube, Payments, B4B / B4S / OVERSIGHT.
Avoid: Spike, Payment Star, star.
Warehouse objects may still say `spike` / `airbyte_spike` until rename.

## Currency

Never aggregate mixed native money. Use as-of FX consolidated measures (`amount_in_eur`, Cards `settlement_in_eur`, …). If the model cannot support that yet, flag it and propose options — rule `no-mixed-currency-aggregates.mdc`.

## Logs

Cross-layer dump (Cube, BI worker, HAProxy, payments/FX jobs, Redshift `sys_query_history`):

```bash
python3 /root/DEV/data-cube/scripts/stack_logs.py snapshot
```

Map: `data-cube/docs/LOGS.md`. Use this before guessing hang/latency causes.

## Deploy

Current UAT is compose on host **`data`**. Later: images we build, on ECS.

Cube `/data/cube`, BI `/data/superset-bi` (data+logs under those trees). Rewire payments: `python3 /root/DEV/data-superset/scripts/wire_superset_to_cube.py`.

Open, not blocking: branch protection/CI, ECR/ECS, platform→product rename, Google/SSO, UX feedback skill. Record decisions in `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
